# API Gateway Standards

## Response Schema
All settlement status endpoints must return the PRD payload shape.
See `zk-proofs.mdc` for the canonical schema.

## Endpoints (MVP)
- `GET /policies/:id` — policy status and trigger config
- `GET /settlements/:id` — settlement result with ZK proof
- `GET /verify/:proofHash` — off-chain ZK proof verification

## RPC Integration
- Use `@solana/web3.js` Connection with devnet RPC from env var `SOLANA_RPC_URL`
- Never expose private keys in API — use a server-side keypair via env var
- Rate-limit RPC calls; cache on-chain account reads where possible

## Database (PostgreSQL)
- Store policy metadata, settlement history, and proof hashes
- On-chain state is source of truth for fund balances — DB is index/cache only
